[{"text":"DiracReduce[exp] reduces all 4-dimensional Dirac matrices in exp to the standard basis \\((S, P, V, A, T)\\) using the Chisholm identity.","anchor":"diracreduce"},{"text":"In the result the basic Dirac structures can be wrapped with a head DiracBasis, that is","anchor":"diracreduce"},{"text":"\\(S\\): DiracBasis[1]","anchor":"diracreduce"},{"text":"\\(P\\): DiracBasis[GA[5]]","anchor":"diracreduce"},{"text":"\\(V\\): DiracBasis[GA[mu]]","anchor":"diracreduce"},{"text":"\\(A\\): DiracBasis[GA[mu, 5]]","anchor":"diracreduce"},{"text":"\\(T\\): DiracBasis[DiracSigma[GA[mu, nu]]]","anchor":"diracreduce"},{"text":"By default DiracBasis is substituted to Identity.","anchor":"diracreduce"},{"text":"Overview, Chisholm, DiracSimplify, EpsChisholm.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"GA[\\[Mu], \\[Nu]] DiracReduce[%]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\mu }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\nu }\\]","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{g}^{\\mu \\nu }-i \\sigma ^{\\mu \\nu }\\]","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"DiracReduce only works with Dirac matrices in 4 dimensions, D-dimensional matrices are ignored.","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GAD[\\[Mu], \\[Nu]] DiracReduce[%]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\gamma ^{\\mu }.\\gamma ^{\\nu }\\]","anchor":"cb2-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\gamma ^{\\mu }.\\gamma ^{\\nu }\\]","anchor":"cb2-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SpinorUBar[Subscript[p, 1], Subscript[m, 1]] . GA[\\[Mu], \\[Nu], \\[Rho]] . SpinorV[Subscript[p, 2], Subscript[m, 2]] DiracReduce[%]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{u}\\left(p_1,m_1\\right).\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\mu }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\nu }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\rho }.v\\left(p_2,m_2\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[i \\bar{\\epsilon }^{\\mu \\nu \\rho \\;\\text{\\$MU}(\\text{\\$31})} \\left(\\varphi (\\overline{p}_1,m_1)\\right).\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\text{\\$MU}(\\text{\\$31})}.\\bar{\\gamma }^5.\\left(\\varphi (-\\overline{p}_2,m_2)\\right)+\\bar{g}^{\\mu \\nu } \\left(\\varphi (\\overline{p}_1,m_1)\\right).\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\rho }.\\left(\\varphi (-\\overline{p}_2,m_2)\\right)-\\bar{g}^{\\mu \\rho } \\left(\\varphi (\\overline{p}_1,m_1)\\right).\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\nu }.\\left(\\varphi (-\\overline{p}_2,m_2)\\right)+\\bar{g}^{\\nu \\rho } \\left(\\varphi (\\overline{p}_1,m_1)\\right).\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\mu }.\\left(\\varphi (-\\overline{p}_2,m_2)\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GA[\\[Mu], \\[Nu], \\[Rho], \\[Sigma]] DiracReduce[%]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\mu }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\nu }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\rho }.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\sigma }\\]","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-i \\bar{\\gamma }^5 \\bar{\\epsilon }^{\\mu \\nu \\rho \\sigma }-i \\sigma ^{\\rho \\sigma } \\bar{g}^{\\mu \\nu }+i \\sigma ^{\\nu \\sigma } \\bar{g}^{\\mu \\rho }-i \\sigma ^{\\nu \\rho } \\bar{g}^{\\mu \\sigma }-i \\sigma ^{\\mu \\sigma } \\bar{g}^{\\nu \\rho }+i \\sigma ^{\\mu \\rho } \\bar{g}^{\\nu \\sigma }-i \\sigma ^{\\mu \\nu } \\bar{g}^{\\rho \\sigma }+\\bar{g}^{\\mu \\sigma } \\bar{g}^{\\nu \\rho }-\\bar{g}^{\\mu \\rho } \\bar{g}^{\\nu \\sigma }+\\bar{g}^{\\mu \\nu } \\bar{g}^{\\rho \\sigma }\\]","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Do some checks of the results","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"DiracSimplify[GA[\\[Mu], \\[Nu], \\[Rho], \\[Sigma]] . GA[\\[Mu], \\[Nu], \\[Rho], \\[Sigma]]]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-128\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"DiracSimplify[DiracReduce[GA[\\[Mu], \\[Nu], \\[Rho], \\[Sigma]]] . DiracReduce[GA[\\[Mu], \\[Nu], \\[Rho], \\[Sigma]]]]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-128\\]","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"We may also keep the head DiracBasis in the final result","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"DiracReduce[GA[\\[Mu], \\[Nu], \\[Rho], \\[Sigma]], FinalSubstitutions -> {}]","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"}]